            ],
            "entities": {},
            "favorite_count": 5427,
            "favorited": false,
            "full_text": "As much as I respect Chinese-made AI models and hardware, I'm equally puzzled by how rough most of the software still is. Whether it's Wechat or Alipay or HarmonyOS. You'd think getting unique aesthetics, perfect fidelity, and great flows would be \"easy\", but clearly it is not.",
